 guide
DTSTAMP:20260916T000000Z
DTSTART:20260916T100000
DTEND:20260916T120000
SUMMARY:What's in the Box? Inside the Hive with Local Beekeeper Theresa De
 vine
DESCRIPTION:Local beekeeper Theresa Devine brings an observation hive full
  of live bees to the Niceville Community Center and walks through how to 
 inspect a hive and read a frame. A separate bee free hive lets a nervous 
 visitor see the same setup without any buzzing. Fresh local honey goes on
